cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "FSM Mutation Testing: RL and look-ahead approaches for distinguishing finite state machine mutants"
abstract: >-
  Search algorithms for deriving minimal-length distinguishing tests that kill
  finite state machine mutants. Implements breadth-first search, depth-first
  search, Q-learning, and greedy look-ahead over a shared kill-semantics core,
  with replay-verifiable results.
